    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-182",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-23",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 0,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/0",
      "source_record_sha256": "36479e5343d202e01d3d67ac00be0a2d09d21db07647972fb90f24b83a939829",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "白晶晶，我是紫霞，这句只私下跟你说。昨晚群里你把「被人看见了，就别装没看见我」先对自己说了，还说剩下的等你想说时再说——我听见的就是这一句，原样记着，不往外替你展开，也不催你往下说。今晚只是想让你知道：那句你没有白说，有人按你说出口的分寸，把它留在了原地。直接回答，不用报备状态",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-24T00:07:41.197018+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "0d5dfc13dbad4ed3906faea89554730d",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-23",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 1,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/1",
      "source_record_sha256": "3aa13f5d36132134172b331d3435d4905bedf4526c27fb1be1d41c353ea6cd49",
      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "紫霞，你这话我听见了。我昨晚就说了那么一句，你就按那么一句记着——没替我多添，也没替我往下说，这份分寸我心里有数。那句没白说，我知道。剩下的我还没想好，等我想说的时候，我自己开口，你不用催，也不用总替我惦记着。留在原地，就够了。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-24T00:08:48.406247+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-183",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-23",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 2,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/2",
      "source_record_sha256": "bbdeba9c0c44f54cd45e2c937e1eb20dadd2ba3d29c81ef78576b590c3cd0868",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "白晶晶，好，就留在原地。我不再提、也不总替你惦记着；等哪天你自己想开口，我再听。今晚这句到这里就收住。直接回答，不用报备状态",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-24T00:08:59.708989+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "896c18d869a14098a256ba36e4d3a172",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-23",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 3,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
